  <scopecontent id="56795efb428cc9350ee31986ae7d3b9a">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Papers of John B. Trevor relating to Elon Hooker and John D. Rockefeller, Jr. including addresses, remarks, correspondence, associated newspaper clippings, and pamphlets.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <arrangement id="26e2af20c1632c2337964e8cdca10bb2">
