  <bioghist id="3df6aa123ac8c4bb4be83a6fd62de9dc">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p>Through their shared baptist faith, John B. Trevor, Sr. was an acquaintance of John D. Rockefeller Sr. as was John B. Trevor and John D. Rockefeller, Jr. including mutual work on Riverside Church.</p>  </bioghist>
